   "text": "Custom-shaped projecting signs",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "A projecting sign shaped like your own symbol is advertising customers remember. The shape speaks for you – without a single word.",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "img",
   "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/635940ec249b210e8902edd4/6aa7bba631b9bc9655495824_lekarenske-znaky-karta.jpg",
