   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Pharmacy signs",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Pharmacy signs are protected by copyright law. And we are one of the few companies licensed to produce them.",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Projecting signs of every type, made to measure",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We produce them in a wide range of designs, variants and shapes. A projecting sign can be square or round, or shaped exactly as you like – a tooth for a dental surgery, for example.",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "How it’s made",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Illuminated and inlaid projecting signs",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "A projecting sign with lighting for better advertising visibility. The inlaid version has shaped illuminated 3D characters for a unique look. The shape of the sign can be adapted exactly as you like, including custom shapes.",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Bespoke and non-illuminated projecting signs",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "A projecting sign tailored to the client’s specific requirements. The non-illuminated version is stylish and understated, ideal for an elegant, modern presentation. A non-illuminated design suits anywhere advertising should look discreet and timeless.",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "div",
   "text": "Unmissable",
   "anchor": "vystrce"
  },
  {
   "type": "div",
   "text": "Noticed by passers-by",
   "anchor": "vystrce"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Illuminated projecting signs",
   "anchor": "vystrce"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Advertising that shines day and night. LED backlighting ensures consistent visibility in bad weather and after dark.",
   "anchor": "vystrce"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Graphics: The face of the sign is covered with printed or plotter-cut graphics. Both the shape of the sign and the graphic design can be adapted exactly as you like, including custom shapes.",
   "anchor": "vystrce"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Material: The frame is an aluminium structure and the face is made of backlit acrylic glass or another sheet material. Brackets for fixing the sign to the wall are welded to the inner frame.",
   "anchor": "vystrce"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Suitable for: Premises that need to be seen from every side – shops on busy streets, restaurants, hotels and anywhere advertising has to attract attention after dark.",
   "anchor": "vystrce"
  },
