  {
   "type": "div",
   "text": "Shaped to your brand",
   "anchor": "atypicke-vystrce"
  },
  {
   "type": "div",
   "text": "Eye-catching at a glance",
   "anchor": "atypicke-vystrce"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Custom-shaped projecting signs",
   "anchor": "atypicke-vystrce"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Visible advertising on a steel structure is unmissable even from far away – and that is what makes it effective.",
   "anchor": "atypicke-vystrce"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Graphics: The shape of the sign follows the silhouette of your trade’s symbol – a tooth, scissors, a heart, a key, a glass or anything a customer instantly connects with your business.",
   "anchor": "atypicke-vystrce"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Material: The frame is an aluminium structure and the face is made of backlit acrylic glass or another sheet material. Brackets for fixing the sign to the wall are welded to the inner frame.",
   "anchor": "atypicke-vystrce"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Suitable for: Businesses with an iconic symbol instantly linked to their trade – dental surgeries (a tooth), hairdressers (scissors), cafés (a cup), wine shops (a vine), credit unions (a key).",
   "anchor": "atypicke-vystrce"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "Request a no-obligation quote",
   "anchor": "atypicke-vystrce"
  },
