   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Pharmacy signs",
   "anchor": "lekarenske-znaky"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "They are protected by copyright law and provide uniform signage for pharmacies and healthcare facilities. We offer a wide range of illuminated and non-illuminated “Pharmacy” signs, decals for shop windows, floors and counters, and other signage.",
   "anchor": "lekarenske-znaky"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Licence: We are one of the few companies licensed to produce pharmacy crosses. Working with Ing. arch. Flašar has allowed us to take part in producing a great many of them.",
   "anchor": "lekarenske-znaky"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Range: Illuminated and non-illuminated “Pharmacy” signs, decals for shop windows, floors and counters, and further supplementary pharmacy signage.",
   "anchor": "lekarenske-znaky"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Suitable for: Signage for pharmacies and for doctors’ surgeries.",
   "anchor": "lekarenske-znaky"
  },
